    "2 cups light beer, such as lager",
    "1 1/2 cups heavy cream",
    "1 clove garlic, grated",
    "kosher salt and freshly ground black pepper",
    "6 ounces grated sharp Cheddar",
    "6 ounces grated Swiss cheese"
